#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:404
msgid "Publish packages"
msgstr "Publicar paquetes"

#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:406
msgid ""
"It's very simple to publish your package to the public PartCAD "
"repository. First, publish your package as a repo on GitHub. Then create "
"a pull request in `the public PartCAD repo <https://github.com/partcad"
"/partcad-index>`_ to add a reference to your package."
msgstr ""
"Es muy sencillo publicar su paquete en el repositorio público de "
"PartCAD. Primero, publique su paquete como un repositorio en GitHub. "
"Luego cree una pull request en `el repositorio público de PartCAD "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad-index>`_ para agregar una "
"referencia a su paquete."
